  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Migration and Development Program Contributing Toward the Sida 2021-2025 Regional LAC Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support regional initiatives in Latin America and the Caribbean region, with the objective to strengthen the socioeconomic integration of Venezuelan migrants in their host communities. This initiative proposes a two-fold approach to contribute to the development of opportunities at regional level. The first, will aim to increase access to income-generating initiatives through, an integrated and harmonized regularization processes and an improved access to employment opportunities. Under the second pillar, IOM&#x2019;s priority is to ensure that local, national and regional policies and decision-making forums appropriately reflect integration needs and priorities of Venezuelan migrants and that local actors have the capacities to design and implement these policies and address arising integration needs.</narrative>
  </description>
